{"headword":"מַעֲשֵׂר²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:28\" href=\"/Numbers.18.28\">Nu 18:28</a></sup> <strong>tenth part, tithe</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:26\" href=\"/Numbers.18.26\">Nu 18:26</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְשַׂר</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.30\">Lv 27:30</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲשַׂר</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:39\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.39\">Ne 10:39</a> (bef. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמַּעֲשֵׂר</span>); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעַשְׂרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.31\">Lv 27:31</a>; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעַשְׂרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:44\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.44\">Ne 12:44</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְשְׂרֹתֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:4\" href=\"/Amos.4.4\">Am 4:4</a> + 3 times;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>tenth part</em> of ḥomer <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.11\">Ez 45:11</a>, of bath v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.14\">14</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>tithe, payment of tenth part:</em> c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> rei <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:20\" href=\"/Genesis.14.20\">Gn 14:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:26\" href=\"/Numbers.18.26\">Nu 18:26</a>; usually cstr. bef. n. rei <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.17\">Dt 12:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.23\">14:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:28\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.26.12\">26:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.30\">Lv 27:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:32\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.32\">32</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.5\">2 Ch 31:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.6\">6</a><sup>(×2;)</s